{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43926","headline":"古兴 三 · 赵氏","name":"古兴 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霁雪舒长野，寒云半幽谷。\n严风振枯条，猨啼抱冰木。\n所嗟游宦子，少小荷天禄。\n前程未云至，凄怆对车仆。\n岁寒成咏歌，日暮栖林朴。\n不惮行险道，空悲年运促。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}